    "plain_text": "Sam Nappi is an American entrepreneur who founded and owns Alliance Energy Group, a private business spanning power generation and natural-gas operations. His companies acquired generating assets across New York. He has also served as a Syracuse University trustee and, with his wife Carol, supported scholarships and local hospital facilities.",
